# What `eas build` leaves out of the upload. EAS reads this file from the
# REPOSITORY ROOT only — a native/.easignore is never consulted — and when it
# exists it replaces every .gitignore in the tree. So the rules below are the
# .gitignore files' own, with one deliberate difference:
#
#   native/assets/webroot.zip is NOT ignored. It is the packed web app — the
#   game itself — built by `npm run bundle` (in CI by native.yml, with the
#   build profile). It is gitignored as build output; left out of the upload,
#   the EAS worker fails at "Unable to resolve module ../assets/webroot.zip".
#
# /native/ios/ and /native/android/ (expo prebuild output, regenerated on the
# worker) keep their leading slash, so the hand-written modules/*/ios
# (cloud-save, device-settings, game-center) still go up.
#
# Keep this in step with the .gitignore files when they change. Check with
#   (cd native && npx eas-cli build:inspect -p ios -s archive -o <dir>)
# that the archive holds native/assets/webroot.zip.

# .gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tmp
.env
.env.local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.coverage/
coverage/
pwa/node_modules/
pwa/dist/
pwa/src/generated/
engine/generated/
/src/generated/
pwa/src/game/assets/
pwa/assets-preview/
docs/_build/
/server-src/
/server-dist/
tauri/webroot/
tauri/target/
tauri/src-tauri/icons/
tauri/src-tauri/gen/
tauri/node_modules/
tauri/release/
tauri/resources/
measurements/
node_modules/
dist/
.next/
.turbo/
site/
site-*/
*.tsbuildinfo
progression.html
progression.json
mob-hp-curve.html
native/store/store.config.json
native/store/screenshots/
native/store/achievements/
tauri/store/screenshots/
tauri/store/achievements/
tauri/store/preview/output/
native/fastlane/metadata/
native/fastlane/screenshots/
native/fastlane/report.xml
native/fastlane/Preview.html
native/fastlane/test_output/
native/.env
native/*.p8
.library-images/
.claude/worktrees/
.codex/
/modtools-lua/
/tsconfig.modtools-lua.json

# native/.gitignore, re-anchored under native/ (rules the root file already
# applies repo-wide are not repeated).
native/**/.expo/
native/**/web-build/
native/**/expo-env.d.ts
native/**/.kotlin/
native/**/*.orig.*
native/**/*.jks
native/**/*.p8
native/**/*.p12
native/**/*.key
native/**/*.mobileprovision
native/**/.metro-health-check*
native/**/npm-debug.*
native/**/yarn-debug.*
native/**/yarn-error.*
native/**/*.pem
native/**/.env*.local
!native/**/.env.example
/native/ios
/native/android

# tauri/.gitignore, re-anchored under tauri/ (rules the root file already
# applies repo-wide are not repeated).
tauri/**/webroot/
tauri/**/target/
/tauri/src-tauri/icons/
/tauri/src-tauri/gen/
tauri/**/release/
tauri/**/resources/
tauri/**/steam_appid.txt
